- **(ABSOLUTELY PROHIBITED)** DO NOT generate ANY Page Object code
- **(ABSOLUTELY PROHIBITED)** DO NOT generate ANY Business Workflow code
- **(ABSOLUTELY PROHIBITED)** DO NOT generate ANY Test Scenario code
- **(ABSOLUTELY PROHIBITED)** DO NOT create ANY test-related files
- **(ABSOLUTELY PROHIBITED)** DO NOT move to Phase 3 or beyond

**REQUIRED ACTIONS**:
- **(MANDATORY)** **CONTINUE RESEARCH FLOW** - return to **[Phase 1](mdc:Phase1_LocatorResearch.mdc)** investigation mode
- **(MANDATORY)** **Document missing steps** - identify which NEW test steps still need research
- **(MANDATORY)** **Resume investigation** - continue page research for missing NEW steps
- **(MANDATORY)** **Save and continue cycle** - repeat investigation → save findings → continue until 100% complete

